              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Production of Certified Seeds of Maize” by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, is designed to support maize farmers in specific districts of Tamil Nadu. By offering a subsidy of ₹1,000/- per quintal, the scheme encourages farmers to produce certified maize seeds, ensuring a steady supply of high-quality seeds.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
